# A whole-DISPLAY capture is a picture of whoever ran the test, at work, and this
# repository is public. The live test writes one here on purpose — it is the
# proof that the display path delivers pixels — and it must never be committed.
#
# testdata/artifacts/window-capture.png IS committed, and the difference is the
# point: that one is a capture of this package's own test window, a blue
# rectangle it drew itself, which discloses nothing.
